{"type":"message","id":"ef8adb4d","parentId":"22417e70","timestamp":"2026-05-02T19:02:10.620Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-05-02 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Possible Lasting Truths: Possible Lasting Truths: Assistant: @Lucus 这是一个关于 **ECHO 势(Shi) 技术架构**的文档，总结如下： ## 核心概念 **「势」**是一个三维编织的动态系统，用时间、空间、关系三个维度配合64卦约束来管理数字资产。 ## 核心理念 - **实际生效配置** = 创作者意图 ∩ 物理法则范围 - **约束不是限制，而是生态的免疫系统** - 代码即法律，约束即保护，分叉即自由 ## 三维编织 | 维度 | 含义 | 档位 | |------|----\n- Reflections: Theme: `assistant` kept surfacing across 73 memories.; confidence: 1.00; evidence: memory/2026-04-14.md:233-236, memory/2026-04-15.md:328-331, memory/2026-04-15.md:338-340; note: reflection\n- Reflections: Theme: `assistant` kept surfacing across 74 memories.; confidence: 1.00; evidence: memory/2026-04-14.md:233-236, memory/2026-04-15.md:328-331, memory/2026-04-15.md:338-340; note: reflection\n- Reflections: Theme: `assistant` kept surfacing across 79 memories.; confidence: 1.00; evidence: memory/2026-04-14.md:233-236, memory/2026-04-15.md:328-331, memory/2026-04-15.md:338-340; note: reflection\n- Possible Lasting Truths: Possible Lasting Truths: Assistant: Okay, we can't use sudo to install system dependencies. Let's try a different approach: first, let's see if we can fetch the page HTML using curl (this won't execute JS but will give us static content). Then we can look\n- Reflections: Theme: `assistant` kept surfacing across 84 memories.; confidence: 1.00; evidence: memory/2026-04-14.md:233-236, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-13.txt:6-6, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-13.txt:7-7; note: reflection\n- Reflections: Theme: `assistant` kept surfacing across 146 memories.; confidence: 1.00; evidence: memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:3-3, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:5-5, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-12.txt:8-8; note: reflection\n- Reflections: Theme: `user` kept surfacing across 95 memories